<title>POLAND: INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 1.2 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</title>
<headline>INVESTORS BID FOR PLN 1.2 BLN OF POLISH T-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors bid for 1.2 billion zlotys of the Polish T-bills against the treasury's 900 million zloty offer, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>Results of the auction should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
